{"seq":1,"slug":"passive-design-strategies","title":"被动式设计策略 Passive Design","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/architectural-technology/green-building/passive-design-strategies","wordCount":2559,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"被动式设计策略-passive-design\">被动式设计策略 Passive Design</h1><p>1967 年，法国物理学家 Félix Trombe 与建筑师 Jacques Michel 在比利牛斯山麓的奥代洛建成了第一面以 Trombe 命名的集热墙：一面涂黑的混凝土墙立在南向玻璃之后，白天吞下阳光，夜里把热量慢慢吐进房间。这项技术没有任何机械部件，却把太阳能采暖做成了建筑构件——它是被动式设计精神的完美注脚：<strong>先让建筑本身干活，再考虑买设备</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-需求削减优先的决策序列\">核心概念：需求削减优先的决策序列</h2><p>被动式设计（Passive Design）指不依赖机械系统、仅通过形态、朝向、围护结构与空间组织调节室内环境的策略。它的价值要在决策序列中理解：建筑能耗 = 需求 × 系统效率 × 能源碳强度，被动式策略作用在最上游的「需求」上——需求削减 30%，下游设备、可再生能源、储能的规模全部等比缩小 30%，这是一切「效率优先」路线（fabric first）的算术基础。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    A[气候分析&lt;br/&gt;温度/太阳辐射/风] --&gt; B{主要矛盾?}&#10;    B -- 冷季采暖 --&gt; C[太阳能得热 +&lt;br/&gt;保温与热惰性]&#10;    B -- 热季降温 --&gt; D[遮阳 + 通风 +&lt;br/&gt;夜间蓄冷]&#10;    B -- 湿热 --&gt; E[通风除湿优先 +&lt;br/&gt;强遮阳]&#10;    C --&gt; F[围护结构深化&lt;br/&gt;U 值/气密/热桥]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[剩余负荷交给&lt;br/&gt;机械系统与可再生能源]\">flowchart TB\n    A[气候分析&lt;br/&gt;温度/太阳辐射/风] --&gt; B{主要矛盾?}\n    B -- 冷季采暖 --&gt; C[太阳能得热 +&lt;br/&gt;保温与热惰性]\n    B -- 热季降温 --&gt; D[遮阳 + 通风 +&lt;br/&gt;夜间蓄冷]\n    B -- 湿热 --&gt; E[通风除湿优先 +&lt;br/&gt;强遮阳]\n    C --&gt; F[围护结构深化&lt;br/&gt;U 值/气密/热桥]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[剩余负荷交给&lt;br/&gt;机械系统与可再生能源]</pre><p>这张图的要点是「先诊断后开方」：湿热气候的被动式优先级与寒冷气候几乎相反（前者通风第一、保温适度；后者保温第一、通风可控），照搬单一气候区的经验清单是被动式设计最常见的失败方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"太阳得热的季节平衡\">太阳得热的季节平衡</h2><p>朝向是被动式设计的第一杠杆。北半球温带地区的经典解法是「长轴东西向、主立面朝南」：冬季太阳高度角低（北京冬至正午约 26.6°），阳光深入室内被热惰性材料吸收；夏季高度角高（北京夏至约 76°），一排水平外遮阳即可挡住绝大部分直射。太阳高度角的几何关系为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>φ</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>δ</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin\\theta_s = \\sin\\varphi \\sin\\delta + \\cos\\varphi \\cos\\delta \\cos h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span></span></span></span></span> 为当地纬度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 为太阳赤纬，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 为时角。水平遮阳板的挑出深度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 与窗口高度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 的关系由正午临界角决定：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = H \\cdot \\tan(90° - \\theta_{c})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">tan</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">90°</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为需要遮挡的临界高度角。这些公式在参数化工具（如 Ladybug）中被逐时计算，但设计师理解几何直觉仍然必要——否则无法判断工具输出是否合理。</p>\n<p>外遮阳的进阶形态是<strong>动态遮阳</strong>。阿布扎比 Al Bahar 塔（Aedas 设计，2012 年竣工）把传统阿拉伯 Mashrabiya 木格窗转译为可动铝幕：约 2,000 个伞状单元随太阳轨迹逐时开合，据项目方公布的数据可减少约 50% 的太阳得热，并因此获得 2012 年 CTBUH 最佳高层建筑奖。它的启示是：在极端日晒气候下，遮阳从「构件」升级为「可动系统」时，投资回报可以成立。</p>\n<p>得热的利用方式分两类。<strong>直接得热</strong>靠南向玻璃 + 室内热惰性地面/墙体，简单高效但依赖住户行为（不能拉遮光帘）；<strong>间接得热</strong>以 Trombe 墙为代表，玻璃与厚墙之间空气被加热后从顶部开口进入室内，墙内形成数小时的热延迟——延迟本身就是调节手段，把正午的峰值热量挪到傍晚使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自然通风的两种驱动力\">自然通风的两种驱动力</h2><p>通风的驱动力只有两种：风压与热压。</p>\n<p><strong>风压通风</strong>（穿堂风）要求进、出风口沿主导风向贯通布置。经验法则是单侧进深的通风有效距离约为进风口高度的 5 倍，超过后效率骤降；进风口小于出风口时气流加速，可用于提高人体侧风速。<strong>热压通风</strong>（烟囱效应）的驱动力是密度差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta p = (\\rho_o - \\rho_i)\\, g\\, H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>室内外温差越大、进出风口垂直高差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，抽力越强。中庭、太阳能烟囱、通风塔都是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 做大的手段。中国传统民居的天井正是热压通风的民间工程学——天井受晒升温，热空气上升，带动厢房空气持续流动。</p>\n<p>两者的组合案例是伦敦附近的 BedZED 零能耗社区（Bill Dunster 设计，2002 年入住）：每户屋顶的彩色风帽（Wind Cowl）迎风面导风入室、背风面抽气排风，气流经过热交换芯回收排风热量——在多风的英国，风压驱动 + 热回收的组合把机械通风的电耗压到最低。</p>\n<p>工程上必须诚实的一点是：自然通风的<strong>可保证性</strong>弱于机械系统。无风闷热夜、室外空气质量差（雾霾、花粉）、噪声超标时，自然通风都要让位于机械通风。当代主流做法是混合通风（Mixed-Mode）：传感器判断室外条件，在自然通风与机械通风间自动切换——新加坡 SDE4 楼（2019 年）即以此在热带实现净零（案例详见 <a href=\"net-zero-energy\">近零能耗建筑</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"围护结构的热工四要素\">围护结构的热工四要素</h2><p>围护结构有四个相互牵制的热工属性，任何一项的过度优化都会在另一项上付出代价。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要素</th>\n<th>度量指标</th>\n<th>典型量级</th>\n<th>牵制关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>隔热</td>\n<td>传热系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U = 1/\\sum R_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>普通墙 0.5–1.0，被动房墙 ≤ 0.15 W/(m²·K)</td>\n<td>越厚越贵，挤占面积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>热桥</td>\n<td>线传热系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ψ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\psi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>未断桥阳台板可占墙体热损失 20% 以上</td>\n<td>需断热连接件，增结构造价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>热惰性</td>\n<td>单位面积热容</td>\n<td>混凝土墙约为轻钢墙的 10 倍量级</td>\n<td>与保温层位置强相关（内保温削弱热惰性）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>气密性</td>\n<td>换气次数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>50</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{50}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">50</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（50 Pa 压差）</td>\n<td>普通建筑 3–10，被动房 ≤ 0.6（单位：次/小时）</td>\n<td>气密必须配热回收新风，否则牺牲空气品质</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>保温材料的导热系数（λ）排序决定了同样热阻下的厚度：膨胀聚苯板（EPS）约 0.033–0.038、岩棉约 0.035–0.040 W/(m·K)，真空绝热板（VIP）可低至 0.004–0.008，气凝胶毡约 0.015–0.020。VIP 与气凝胶的每平方米单价远高于常规材料，其合理场景是改造项目等「厚度受限」场合——新建项目为省几厘米厚度付出数倍材料费，通常不划算。</p>\n<p>热桥是隔热体系的阿喀琉斯之踵：阳台板、窗框、女儿墙等穿透保温层的构件形成短路。德国 Schöck 公司的 Isokorb 断热连接件（承载式合成材料连接件）是行业标杆方案，外保温系统（ETICS）则是无热桥设计的体系化做法。判断一个保温方案是否专业的快速检验：看它的二维热工节点图是否齐全。</p>\n<h2 id=\"日光与眩光的量化\">日光与眩光的量化</h2><p>采光设计要同时回答「够不够亮」与「刺不刺眼」两个问题，而两者的指标体系长期分裂。</p>\n<p>传统指标采光系数（Daylight Factor, DF）定义为室内水平照度与室外全阴天水平照度之比，静态且不反映朝向与气候差异，但计算简单，仍是快速校核工具。当代主流指标是<strong>空间日光自主度</strong>（sDA）：一年中至少 50% 的使用时间、工作面照度达到 300 lux 的面积百分比——IES 的 LM-83 文件（2012）规范了其计算方法，LEED v4 起以 sDA300/50% ≥ 55%（或 75%）作为采光得分门槛。与之配套的 ASE（年度眩光暴露，年 1,000 小时以上超过 1,000 lux 的面积占比）专门惩罚过晒，防止「为凑 sDA 而开大窗」。</p>\n<p>增大采光进深的经典手段是<strong>光架</strong>（Light Shelf）：窗中部横置的反射板把直射阳光反射到天花板，再漫反射至房间深处，可将有效采光进深从窗高的约 1.5–2 倍延展到 2.5 倍左右；同时它在视线高度遮挡直射，缓解近窗眩光——一件构件同时服务两个指标。天窗的采光效率约为同面积侧窗的 3 倍，是大进深平面的首选，但需处理夏季得热与渗漏风险。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反模式与常见误区\">反模式与常见误区</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>为造型牺牲朝向</strong>：转角塔楼、全玻璃幕墙在温带气候下同时恶化冬夏两个季节的性能，再用大功率 HVAC 找补——这是把成本从图纸转移到了五十年的电费单上。</li>\n<li><strong>气密性做了、热回收没配</strong>：高气密 + 无热回收新风 = 节能不节碳还闷，被动房标准把两者绑定为成对要求正是为此。</li>\n<li><strong>内保温压掉热惰性</strong>：保温层贴在内侧，墙体蓄热体被隔离在保温层之外，昼夜温度波动反而加大；温带重质墙体的正确顺序通常是「结构蓄热体在内、保温在外」。</li>\n<li><strong>照搬气候区经验</strong>：把北方「保温至上」清单用于湿热地区，会造出不通风的温室。一切从当地气候诊断出发。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>被动式设计作用于能耗链条最上游的需求端，需求每削减一分，下游设备与可再生能源规模等比缩小——这是 fabric first 的算术本质。</li>\n<li>太阳几何决定朝向与遮阳的基本盘：冬季低角度得热、夏季高角度遮挡，动态遮阳在极端日晒气候下回报成立。</li>\n<li>自然通风靠风压与热压（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta p = (\\rho_o - \\rho_i) g H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>）驱动，可保证性弱于机械系统，混合通风是当代务实解。</li>\n<li>围护四要素（隔热、热桥、热惰性、气密）互相牵制，成对配置（气密 + 热回收、外保温 + 重质蓄热）比单项极致更重要。</li>\n<li>采光指标已从静态 DF 演进到 sDA + ASE 组合，前者保证亮度、后者惩罚过晒，两者必须同时校核。</li>\n<li>被动式把需求压到极限之后，认证体系如何为这些性能定价，见 <a href=\"green-certification\">绿色建筑认证体系</a>；物理机理（传热、湿迁移）的纵深推导见本 category 的建筑物理专题，此处不展开。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"被动式设计策略 Passive Design","id":"被动式设计策略-passive-design"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：需求削减优先的决策序列","id":"核心概念-需求削减优先的决策序列"},{"level":2,"text":"太阳得热的季节平衡","id":"太阳得热的季节平衡"},{"level":2,"text":"自然通风的两种驱动力","id":"自然通风的两种驱动力"},{"level":2,"text":"围护结构的热工四要素","id":"围护结构的热工四要素"},{"level":2,"text":"日光与眩光的量化","id":"日光与眩光的量化"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式与常见误区","id":"反模式与常见误区"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"BIM 与数字孪生 BIM and Digital Twin","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/architectural-technology/parametric-design/bim-digital-twin"},"next":{"title":"绿色建筑认证体系 Green Building Certification","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/architectural-technology/green-building/green-certification"}}